{
 "title": "Grafana",
 "uid": "grafana-internals",
 "tags": [
  "grafana",
  "observability"
 ],
 "description": "Replaces gnetId 3590, which filters every panel on kubernetes_pod_name -- a label from an older kube-prometheus scheme that does not exist in this Prometheus. Every query there matched nothing, and the dashboard rendered as a page of empty panels with no indication why.\n\nWorth noting how that got through: a metric-name check passed it at 96%, because every metric it names does exist. Name coverage says nothing about whether the label selectors match.",
 "schemaVersion": 39,
 "version": 1,
 "editable": true,
 "graphTooltip": 1,
 "refresh": "1m",
 "time": {
  "from": "now-12h",
  "to": "now"
 },
 "timezone": "",
